   450	forged marker is a cheaper route to an outcome §6 *already* concedes and already
   451	serves without any forgery; at a fingerprint-changing open it is a genuine loss —
   452	it converts *"caught at the next fingerprint-changing open"* into *"never caught"*,
   453	removing the last recurring detection opportunity §6 left standing. That is the
   454	finding's real weight. It is not "no new attack surface"; nor is it a new class of
   455	exposure, since the actor it requires already owns the file (§8.6).
